## Algoritma Enkripsi

Sistem login mencoba 3 tipe enkripsi secara berurutan hingga salah satu cocok dengan password di database.

### Tipe 1 — MD5_WITH_KEY (Prioritas Pertama)

```
hash = md5("KDFLDMSTHBWWSGCBH" + md5(password) + "KDFLDMSTHBWWSGCBH")
```

**Contoh PHP:**

```php
$password = "mypassword123";
$private_key = "KDFLDMSTHBWWSGCBH";
$hash = md5($private_key . md5($password) . $private_key);
```

---

### Tipe 2 — MD5_ONLY (Prioritas Kedua)

```
hash = md5(password)
```

**Contoh PHP:**

```php
$password = "mypassword123";
$hash = md5($password);
```

---

### Tipe 3 — SHA256_PASS_HASH (Prioritas Ketiga / Default)

```
inner_hash = hash_hmac("sha256", password, hash("sha256", "KDFLDMSTHBWWSGCBH"))
hash = password_hash(inner_hash, PASSWORD_BCRYPT)
```

**Contoh PHP:**

```php
$password = "mypassword123";
$private_key = "KDFLDMSTHBWWSGCBH";
$inner = hash_hmac("sha256", $password, hash("sha256", $private_key, false));
$hash = password_hash($inner, PASSWORD_BCRYPT);
// Output: $2y$10$... (bcrypt hash)
```

---

## Proses Login

Berikut urutan proses autentikasi saat login (`AuthenticationController::loginAction`):

```
1. Terima input LOGIN dan PASSWORD
2. Coba autentikasi dengan Tipe 1 (MD5_WITH_KEY)
   └─ Jika cocok → login berhasil
3. Coba autentikasi dengan Tipe 2 (MD5_ONLY)
   └─ Jika cocok → login berhasil
4. Coba autentikasi dengan Tipe 3 (SHA256_PASS_HASH)
   └─ Load password dari DB, bandingkan dengan password_verify()
   └─ Jika cocok → login berhasil
5. Jika semua gagal → login ditolak
```

