## Membuat Password Baru Secara Manual

### Cara 1: Via PHP CLI

```bash
php -r '
$password = "PasswordBaru123";
$private_key = "KDFLDMSTHBWWSGCBH";
$inner = hash_hmac("sha256", $password, hash("sha256", $private_key, false));
echo password_hash($inner, PASSWORD_BCRYPT) . "\n";
'
```

### Cara 2: Via Script PHP

```php
<?php
// generate_password.php
$password = "PasswordBaru123";
$private_key = "KDFLDMSTHBWWSGCBH";

$inner = hash_hmac("sha256", $password, hash("sha256", $private_key, false));
$hashed = password_hash($inner, PASSWORD_BCRYPT);

echo "Password: $password\n";
echo "Hash: $hashed\n";
?>
```

Jalankan:

```bash
php generate_password.php
```

### Cara 3: Update Langsung ke Database

```sql
UPDATE aplikasi.pengguna
SET PASSWORD = '$2y$10$...ganti_dengan_hash_hasil...'
WHERE ID = <id_user>
  AND STATUS = 1;
```

